[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2828532661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-2828532661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":2828532661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ol_u1","user":{"login":"nrichards","id":704698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNDY5OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/704698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards","html_url":"https://github.com/nrichards","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nrichards/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-24T18:31:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-24T18:41:26Z","body":"Researching. Speculate it's from loading thumbnails. (I get similar -- `-110`'s mostly, when paging through Asset Lib, from Seattle WA, USA).\n\nRelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820 Many related closed issues. Error code deets ([I believe](https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/blob/development/include/mbedtls/ssl.h)) =\n\n* `-110` error is:\n `#define MBEDTLS_SSL_ALERT_MSG_UNSUPPORTED_EXT      110  /* 0x6E */`\n\n* `-28928` is (hex):\n `/** Bad input parameters to function. */`\n `#define MBEDTLS_ERR_SSL_BAD_INPUT_DATA                    -0x7100`\n\n* `-29056` is (hex):\n `/** Verification of the message MAC failed. */`\n `#define MBEDTLS_ERR_SSL_INVALID_MAC                       -0x7180`\n\n* `-28160` is (hex):\n `/** The handshake negotiation failed. */`\n `#define MBEDTLS_ERR_SSL_HANDSHAKE_FAILURE                 -0x6E00`","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2828532661/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850404793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-2850404793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":2850404793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p5bm5","user":{"login":"laws65","id":59809375,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODA5Mzc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59809375?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65","html_url":"https://github.com/laws65","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laws65/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T09:19:48Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T09:19:48Z","body":"> Related: #104820\nWhich issue is related? You linked my own!\n\nThanks for looking into this","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850404793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850442314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-2850442314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":2850442314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p5kxK","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T09:34:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T09:38:40Z","body":"I can reproduce this too on Linux in 4.4.1-stable and 4.4-stable (from Denmark, in case latency comes into play).\n\nLoading the current front page of the Asset Lib on the Project Manager: \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cec9cfd-7ce8-495b-81ca-dbed66b20b6d)\n\nThe following errors are printed:\n```\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -28928\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x7100\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -110\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x6e\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -110\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x6e\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -110\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x6e\n```\n\nThose match the 4 broken thumbnails.\n\nClick the first broken one (Exponaut), I get those errors:\n```\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -28928\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x7100\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -110\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x6e\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -29056\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x7180\n\nERROR: TLS handshake error: -28160\n   at: _do_handshake (modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:88)\nmbedtls error: returned -0x6e00\n```\nand the thumbnail was still broken in the detailed view.\n\nTrying a second time with the same asset, the thumbnail loaded fine, with no errors.\n\nSwitching back and forth between pages 1 and 2 of the Asset Lib (still in the Project Manager), I see that different assets randomly fail loading their thumbnail each time (we don't seem to cache the results?).\n\nAnd after a few switches I get a crash:\n```\nfree(): double free detected in tcache 2\nAborted (core dumped)\n```\nOr this one:\n```\ntcache_thread_shutdown(): unaligned tcache chunk detected\nAborted (core dumped)\n```\nOr one seen with 4.4-stable:\n```\nmalloc_consolidate(): unaligned fastbin chunk detected\nAborted (core dumped)\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850442314/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850474046","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-2850474046","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":2850474046,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p5sg-","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T09:47:35Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T09:47:35Z","body":"I don't reproduce the issue in 4.3-stable, so it seems to be a regression in 4.4.\nIt seems to have been introduced in 4.4-dev3, so most likely by #96394. CC @Faless ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2850474046/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3127056771","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-3127056771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":3127056771,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66YxmD","user":{"login":"samwega","id":60224874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjI0ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60224874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega","html_url":"https://github.com/samwega","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samwega/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T12:41:54Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T12:41:54Z","body":"Got the same issue today with v4.4.1.stable.arch_linux (manjaro) even tho it was working fine yesterday. Still no solution to this? Should I get an older version (4.3)?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3127056771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146628327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-3146628327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":3146628327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67jbzn","user":{"login":"tck42","id":10081856,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDgxODU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10081856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42","html_url":"https://github.com/tck42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T17:22:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T17:22:16Z","body":"> Got the same issue today with v4.4.1.stable.arch_linux (manjaro) even tho it was working fine yesterday. Still no solution to this? Should I get an older version (4.3)?\n\nI was able to work around it until it's fixed by going into Editor Settings -> Network -> TLS and then _uncheck_ \"Enable TLS V 1.3\" and then restart the editor; maybe this works for you as well? If so, be sure to monitor updates to your systems' godot and mbedtls packages and test if it's fixed when they upgrade so you can re-enable that option to get back the performance and security gains of tlsv1.3.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146628327/reactions","total_count":24,"+1":13,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":9,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146630950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-3146630950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":3146630950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67jccm","user":{"login":"EmilChoparinov","id":30579277,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNTc5Mjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30579277?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov","html_url":"https://github.com/EmilChoparinov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmilChoparinov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-02T17:28:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-02T17:28:12Z","body":"@tck42 Thank you so much! You edit worked. Nice timing too :) ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146630950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191589135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-3191589135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":3191589135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-O8kP","user":{"login":"dating92","id":57883649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3ODgzNjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57883649?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92","html_url":"https://github.com/dating92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dating92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T14:07:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T14:07:59Z","body":"That fix works great in-editor, but I'd still love to be able to check the Asset Library (or connect at all) in the regular Godot app. Launching through the terminal I get that same handshake error, so I wonder if there's some way to disable TLS V 1.3 in there too.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191589135/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191684922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-3191684922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":3191684922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-PT86","user":{"login":"tck42","id":10081856,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDgxODU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10081856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42","html_url":"https://github.com/tck42","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tck42/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T14:49:56Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T14:49:56Z","body":"Ah, I hadn't noticed that. The main app also does an update check which fails. I don't see an environment variable, config value or cmdline switch at first glance that disables tlsv3 here as well.\n\nAs this appears to be an issue caused by this version of godot being incompatible with the system version of mbedtls (or a bug in mbedtls, not sure), another option to work around this in general may be to (temporarily) head to the release page and download the 4.4.1 zip for your architecture (which I presume is linux x86_64); that seems to be a single static binary with a working mbedtls statically linked in. At least for me, running that doesn't show the error even in the main launcher. Hopefully that works for you too?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191684922/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3193036407","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104820#issuecomment-3193036407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104820","id":3193036407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Ud53","user":{"login":"dating92","id":57883649,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3ODgzNjQ5","avatar_url":"https://av